{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Retail Simulator Demo, you start out with a small plot, pocket change, and a dream. Slowly gain revenue by selling a wide range of categorized products, from a Teddy Bear to a Gaming Keyboard!\u00a0Expand your store, hire employees, level up and become the biggest retail store of all! The Demo is restricted to level 15. Higher level required products are locked, Plot purchasing is locked and you can only hire one Restocker and one Cashier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862780/extras/ac2cac4d2e47e90606aed4359ffaaa29.avif?t=1753869253\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter build mode with a top-down view, precision place shelves and racks or use grid mode. Place walls, windows, lights, and sliding doors to your liking. Build a custom floor layout that suites your needs.\u00a0  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862780/extras/6f0f8d66c0f3013a94afa1e8448244fb.poster.avif?t=1753869253\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862780/extras/6f0f8d66c0f3013a94afa1e8448244fb.webm?t=1753869253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862780/extras/6f0f8d66c0f3013a94afa1e8448244fb.mp4?t=1753869253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862780/extras/be15c116d5574e33a4791cce88390877.avif?t=1753869253\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Developed with friends in mind, you can build, manage, and thrive with yourself and up to 3 other people. Use Steam overlay to invite or join.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862780/extras/11d968489a654d159056f163629e5559.poster.avif?t=1753869253\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862780/extras/11d968489a654d159056f163629e5559.webm?t=1753869253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862780/extras/11d968489a654d159056f163629e5559.mp4?t=1753869253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862780/extras/d4889d58e77a1a9377c2842c38776de4.avif?t=1753869253\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add products to your shopping cart via the mobile tablet, place an order and await the delivery truck! Make sure storage racks are assigned so restockers can move inventory around</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862780/extras/26e9a4108669983eb344ae8c02c7e52e.poster.avif?t=1753869253\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862780/extras/26e9a4108669983eb344ae8c02c7e52e.webm?t=1753869253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862780/extras/26e9a4108669983eb344ae8c02c7e52e.mp4?t=1753869253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"